<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5c0126-zh-99bf3163" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>莊子譯注</title><editor role="translator">Meng Qingxiang 孟慶祥</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title>莊子譯注</title>哈爾濱：黑龍江人民出版社，2003</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR5c0126"><title xml:lang="och">莊子</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="zh">modern Chinese</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2025-09-01T23:20:52.222+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR5c0126-start"><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:21:51.088+09:00">通达性命实情的人,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:03.062+09:00">不去追求性命所不能做到的东西;</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:43.808+09:00">通达命运实情的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:57.594+09:00">养育形体必先有财物，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:22:54.854+09:00">不去追求命运所无可奈何的东西。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:05.3+09:00">财物充余而形体养不好的大有人在;</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:14.309+09:00">存活必定先不能离开形体,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:23.006+09:00">形体不死而生命死去的大有人在。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:28.961+09:00">生命的到来不能推却，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:33.051+09:00">生命离去不能留住。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:41.854+09:00">可悲啊！</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:23:47.898+09:00">世俗的人以为养育形体就足以保存生命，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:24:10.125+09:00">而养育形体果真不足以保存生命，那么，世事还有什么值得做呢？</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:08.119+09:00">虽然不值得做</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:13.117+09:00">却又不能不做，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_019-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-09-01T23:25:15.157+09:00">就是不能免除。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.16" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:45:09.539+09:00">任国公子钓上这条鱼后，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.17" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:45:17.203+09:00">把它剖开、晒干，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.18" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:45:31.559+09:00">从浙江以东</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.2" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:40:27.805+09:00">任国公子制成了一个由粗长黑索链组成的大钓钩，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.3" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:40:39.478+09:00">用五十头阉牛做为钓饵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.4" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:41:16.679+09:00">蹲坐在会稽山上,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.5" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:41:28.367+09:00">把钓竿垂入东海之中，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.6" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:41:48.36+09:00">终日垂钓,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.7" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:01.151+09:00">整整一年都没有钓到鱼。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.8" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:10.842+09:00">最终，一条大鱼吞食了鱼饵，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.9" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:24.17+09:00">牵引着大钓钩，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.10" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:35.567+09:00">时而沉入水中，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.11" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:51.196+09:00">时而摆着摆着鱼鳍一跃而起，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.12" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:42:58.602+09:00">掀起如山的白浪,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.13" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:43:16.032+09:00">海水受到震荡后</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.14" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:43:26.255+09:00">发出如同鬼哭神泣般的声音，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.15" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:43:39.148+09:00">使数千里之人感到震惊。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.19" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:46:01.344+09:00">到苍梧山以北的人</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.20" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:46:12.405+09:00">全都饱食此鱼。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.21" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:46:36.379+09:00">这件事过去之后，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.22" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:46:44.459+09:00">后世才疏学浅且喜欢道听途说的人</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.23" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:46:55.733+09:00">都惊喜地奔走相告。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.24" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:01.346+09:00">举着短竿细绳，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.25" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:07.253+09:00">驻立在小水沟旁，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.26" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:14.62+09:00">等着小鱼上钩，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.27" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:25.588+09:00">这就很难钓上来大鱼了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.28" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:42.215+09:00">靠文过饰非的浅薄言论</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.29" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:47.877+09:00">去追求美闻高名，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.30" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:47:59.127+09:00">这离大道的境界相距太远了。</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.31" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:48:04.835+09:00">因此，那些从未听说过任公子高瞻远瞩钓大鱼风范的人，</seg><seg corresp="#KR5c0126_tls_026-3a.32" generatedBy="human" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-08-24T00:53:58.886+09:00">他们距离经世济用的道理也很远了。</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>